#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:44 ded4b6cc35394bbeadf5721d2c521928
msgid ""
"There is exactly one link rule: the aggregate target :code:`foc::foc`. It"
" carries both :code:`foc::foc_c` and :code:`foc::foc_cpp`, and the "
"package metadata guarantees the order."
msgstr ""
"只需要记一条链接规则：聚合目标 :code:`foc::foc` 。它同时带 :code:`foc::foc_c` 与 "
":code:`foc::foc_cpp` ，顺序由包元数据保证。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:49 5ce26c4e8e88414997f5fc9e14f8ae9f
msgid ""
"A C consumer still links the C++ runtime. The ABI is stable, the "
"implementation is C++: set :code:`LINKER_LANGUAGE CXX` (or add one empty "
":code:`.cpp`), otherwise the link fails on :code:`__cxa_*`. This is a "
"documented boundary, not an accident."
msgstr ""
"C 使用者仍要链接 C++ 运行时。ABI 是稳定的，但实现是 C++：把 :code:`LINKER_LANGUAGE CXX` "
"设上（或加一个空 :code:`.cpp` ），否则会在 :code:`__cxa_*` 上链接失败。这是写明的边界，不是失误。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:54 b38b4470c3d74cd5a7026e7eeb7408ff
msgid "_`3. Pick a face`"
msgstr "_`3. 选择使用面`"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:56 0612ec5360204595aef3cc52ffdc9767
msgid ""
"**C++17** — board-level work, your own :code:`HalPolicy`, your own gains:"
" see :ref:`the C++ path <cpp-control-step>`."
msgstr ""
"**C++17** ——上板开发，用自己的 :code:`HalPolicy` 、自己的增益：见 :ref:`C++ 路径 <cpp-"
"control-step>` 。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:58 6dbf5a91e43d4c5a9f225d9421d01cad
msgid ""
"**C11** — non-C++ projects and glue code over the frozen ABI: see "
":ref:`the C path <c-control-step>`."
msgstr "**C11** ——非 C++ 工程，走冻结 ABI 的胶水层：见 :ref:`C 路径 <c-control-step>` 。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:60 30a9a29984a34a43915bbb6b673ef222
msgid ""
"**Python** — host-side scripts on top of the C API: see :ref:`the Python "
"path <python-control-step>`."
msgstr "**Python** ——建立在 C API 之上的上位机脚本：见 :ref:`Python 路径 <python-control-step>` 。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:63 13952d41012d47b58fdad1d39e5852cd
msgid ""
"Each snippet on that page is complete enough to compile, and the C and "
"Python faces run on the stub HAL with library defaults (20 kHz, 500 ns "
"dead time, 5 A limit, 24 V bus)."
msgstr ""
"那一页的每段代码都足以编译；C 与 Python 面跑在桩 HAL 与库内默认值上（20 kHz、500 ns 死区、5 A 限流、24 V "
"母线）。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:67 a32ddd162c01453082fb353ac7cda8dc
msgid "_`4. From zero to a servo, in one file`"
msgstr ""
"_`4. 一个文件，从零到伺服`"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:69 df87c3c8f7e54105912b1b304448190e
msgid ""
"The file below is the shortest complete example: a dq machine in Python "
"behind the HAL callback protocol, the library's own speed loop closed on "
"it, one speed step, and an assertion on where the axis landed. It is not "
"a copy of an example -- it *is* the example, and the test suite executes "
"it, so this page cannot drift from working code:"
msgstr ""
"下面这个文件是最短的完整示例：一台 dq 电机以 Python 形式挂在 HAL 回调协"
"议之后，库自带的速度环闭合在它上面，走一次速度阶跃，最后断言轴停在哪里。"
"它不是某个示例的复制品——它 *就是* 那个示例，测试套件会执行它，所以本页不"
"可能与可运行的代码脱节："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:77 eb5b8df22a0d456e8c5a970bebc06c5a
msgid "Run it yourself with the module on the path:"
msgstr ""
"把模块放到路径上，自己跑一遍："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:83 eba1751d5a184f96bc48056551959ac6
#, python-format
msgid ""
"It prints what the axis did. Measured on this machine: it lands 0.007 "
"rad/s short of the 20 rad/s command, peaks 1.3 % high, and stays inside a"
" 0.14 rad/s band over the last 100 ms -- the residual being mechanical "
"ripple rather than a control error, which is one of the :doc:`documented "
"limits <boundaries>`."
msgstr ""
"它打印出轴实际做了什么。在本机实测：它比 20 rad/s 的指令低了 0.007 rad/s"
"，峰值高出 1.3 %，最后 100 ms 内始终待在 0.14 rad/s 的带内——这点残差是机"
"械纹波而不是控制误差，属于 :doc:`已记录的限制 <boundaries>` 之一。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:87 e174b26f84664cb8b512a316bef368c4
msgid ""
"What it deliberately is *not*: a sensorless example (the plant reports a "
"velocity, so the library takes the angle and the speed from it), and a "
"proof of accuracy on your machine. Both are covered where they belong -- "
"the injection observer and its boundaries, and the SIL tests that measure"
" the loop against a plant."
msgstr ""
"它刻意 *不是* 什么：不是无感示例（plant 直接给出转速，库就从它取角度和速"
"度），也不是“在你的机器上精度如何”的证明。这两件事都在该在的地方讲了——注"
"入观测器及其边界，以及对着 plant 测量闭环的 SIL 测试。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:92 1b3a0c52091149398714fd7abc54ccfc
msgid "_`5. Prove it yourself`"
msgstr ""
"_`5. 自己验证`"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:114 3ae6525c325c4c2bbf926b16a74dc077
msgid ""
"What is deliberately **not** verified — dead-time compensation, ADC "
"timing, EMI, ISR worst-case time, flash/RAM footprint — is listed item by"
" item under :ref:`honest limits <honest-limits>`."
msgstr ""
"明确 **没有** 验证的内容——死区补偿、ADC 时序、EMI、ISR 最坏执行时间、Flash/RAM 占用——逐条列在 :ref:`诚实边界"
" <honest-limits>` 。"

